{"version":1,"key":"card:207","content":{"id":207,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含一系列查找元素的方法，包括："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementById","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementByTagName","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getElementByClassName"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementByName","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelector","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"querySelectorAll"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"text":"getElementById","type":"formatted"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementById","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"id","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 值来获得文档树中的一个节点，例如对于下面的 HTML 代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<div id=\"box\"></div>","language":"html","uuid":"a911baf3-600d-45f4-adb6-e6579c597eb1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"div","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"id","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，它的值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"box","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此我们可以通过下面的代码来获得该节点"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let box = document.getElementById(\"box\");","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e7f1e00a-a870-4186-9b3c-6da95cfc9a35","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，如果文档有多个节点它们的 ","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"id","code":true,"bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相同，当我们使用 ","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementById","code":true,"bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 去查找节点时，会返回第一个匹配的节点。","bold":true}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"getElementsByTagName"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementByTagName","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 根据标签名来获得文档树中的节点，该方法返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"HTMLCollection","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"NodeList","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类似，它也是一个类数组，我们可以通过下标来访问该对象包含的元素。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let images = document.getElementsByTagName(\"img\"); // 获得文档中所以的 img 节点","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f946b427-541e-4353-9d14-090d86c35780","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们获得 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"images","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"HTMLCollection","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，它除了可以使用下标的形式获得集合中的元素，还可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"namedItem","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来获得相应的元素，假设文档中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img name=\"img1\" src=\"\" />","language":"HTML","uuid":"efde137b-d02b-43fa-9ffc-9f8e5a11e679","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"该 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"name","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"img1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么我们可以通过下面的方式来获得该节点"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"images.namedItem(\"img1\");`","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"dcc8babd-b92a-4cc9-98b1-276285448e9c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementsByClassName"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementsByClassName","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以通过类型来查找元素，由于可以多个元素存在相同的类型，因此返回的也是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"HTMLCollection","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const disabled = document.getElementsByClassName('disabled');\nArray.from(disabled).forEach(disabledEle => {\n\tdisabledEle.style.color = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, .2)';\n});","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"eeac1554-adcc-4ce6-86f4-839ce3032484","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"getElementsByName"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"该方法是根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"name","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来获得节点的，该方法返回的是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"NodeList","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一般这个方法是用来取得单选按钮，因为单选按钮必须拥有相同的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"name","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性。假设有如下单选按钮"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<input type=\"ratio\" value=\"green\" name=\"color\" />\n<input type=\"ratio\" value=\"red\" name=\"color\" />\n<input type=\"ratio\" value=\"blue\" name=\"color\" />","language":"HTML","uuid":"885c1cc7-4f4f-4cb6-aa21-90b1282345a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以通过下面的方法获得所以的单选按钮"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"document.getElementsByName(\"color\");","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6dd21a76-cb31-4e6e-8c66-ec6b2f2c0ebb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelector"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelector","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以直接通过选择器来选择元素，只能选择一个元素，如果有多个符合条件的元素，只会选择第一个，无法没有找到能匹配的元素，则会返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 通过 id 来查找元素\nconst btn = document.querySelector('#btn');\n// 通过类来查找元素\nconst disabled = document.querySelector('.disabled');\n// 通过标签来查找元素\nconst div = document.querySelector('div');","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"255b0549-4e5d-4a7a-9b37-451762893575","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用选择器的组合也是可以的"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const text = document.querySelector('.card .text');","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"74a0e7f6-bdf3-4c83-a3a0-b22c20bec240","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelector","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不仅仅是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方法，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Element","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象也可以直接调用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelector","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，只会查找该元素下的元素。"}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelectorAll"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelectorAll","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 同 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"querySelector","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一样，也是接收 CSS 选择器来查找元素，同 querySelector 不同的，它会找到所有符合条件的元素，他返回的是一个 NodeList 对象，可以通过下标来访问到查找的元素，但是它不是一个数组，而是一个伪数组，因此无法调用数组的方法。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const images = document.querySelectorAll('img');","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0b69f893-a4de-4e3a-a983-6fed80ce6655","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM"],"createTime":1690469473542,"updateTime":1743303640409,"linkedCards":[{"id":155,"target":{"key":"card:155","type":"card","id":155},"summary":"通过 CSS 我们可以为标签添加样式，那么为哪一个标签添加样式，怎么给特定的标签添加样式，这就需要用到 CSS 选择器。 标签选择器 直接通过标签来